p:64-104` + `libs/cache_engine/abi/abi_adapter.hpp:1352-1363` (**geteilt von allen 7 → EIN Strom**) · P5/T4: `libs/cache_engine/axes/node/` · P6/T6: `libs/cache_engine/…/i_allocation_strategy.hpp` |\n| **B13 headless-CLI** | beide | ce `apps/experiment_planner/main.cpp`, beide Reader-Header, `builder/experiment_tree/cache_engine_builder_iterator.hpp`, `tests/CMakeLists`; super `MANUAL_RUN.md`, `.gitlab-ci.yml` (Job `experiment:start`) — **6 belegte Direkt-Überlappungen** |\n| **F3/Weg a (Scheibe 6)** | ce+super | ce `tests/unit/thesis_tiere/experiment_golden_kern.xml` → `…/experiment_kern_seam_fixture.xml` (git mv) · ce `test_experiment_kern_seam.cpp` (6 von 15 TEST-Blöcken lesen die Fixture) · super `Code/tests/CMakeLists.txt:174` (`-DFIXTURE=`) · **Gitlink-Bump im SELBEN super-Commit** |\n| **F5 GOLDEN-UPDATE** | ce+super | super `Code/test_data_xml/experiment_golden_kern.xml` (MASTER) · ce `libs/cache_engine/…/source_catalog.hpp:190` (CRC64-TABU) · `tools/gen_golden_fullpilot` · `all_axes_golden.profile.xml`, `m3v2_study.profile.xml`, `permutation_axes.xml`, `golden_fullpilot_320_binary_ids.txt` (**TABU-Artefakte**) |\n| **Lager-Basis-Tests** | ce | `tests/unit/` (neu) · `libs/cache_engine/builder/bestandslog/` · später `libs/cache_engine/abi/` (Stempel-Interface) |\n| **Graph-Folgeposten (1×N-Fatal, leere 3D-caption)** | super | `Code/05_diagram_generator/diagram_generator.cpp` |\n| **`axis_inventory.tex`** | super + thesis | super `Code/08_appendix_generator/appendix_generator.cpp:423` · thesis 289 `anhang/{de,en}/*.tex` |\n\n### Disjunktheits-Vorbefund (nur Datei-Ebene, ohne Reihenfolge-Doktrin)\n\n**Klar disjunkt und sofort parallelisierbar:**\n- **T-i-1** (super `Code/tests/`) ⟂ **T-i-2** (ce `tools/` + `tests/unit/`) ⟂ **i-1/i-2/i-3** (ce `profile_facade/planner/` + `tests/unit/thesis_tiere/`) ⟂ **Host-Belegung** (super `Code/02_messung_driver/`) ⟂ **Gate 8** (thesis 289 `anhang/`) ⟂ **E18-SNAP** (super `ci/` + `docs/`) ⟂ **Graph-Folgeposten** (super `Code/